// Evolution-path graph — DATA, not code (ADR-0006/0057/0174). Replaces the
// deleted evolutions.ron and fusion.ron entirely (spec EG3-1).
//
// Each entry is one directed edge with an author-assigned, unique, APPEND-ONLY
// edge_id (EG1-4/EG1-12 — never reused, never renumbered, even if the edge is
// later removed). Shape:
//
// (
//     edge_id: 1,
//     from_species: 7,
//     to_species: 9,
//     min_level: 18,
//     essence: [(affinity: Water, amount: 100)],
//     min_trust_tier: Some(Friendly),
//     min_quality_time_tier: Some(2),
//     min_nutrition_pct: Some(50),
// ),
//
// DELIBERATELY EMPTY in EG1: the schema/type freeze ships before the content
// pass (EG3) authors the real graph. R1-R12 are runnable against this empty
// set (EG1-10), and R10 (universal reachability) explicitly skips it
// (ADR-0174 D6) so the tier: 1 species EG1-3 authors do not deadlock
// sync_content during the EG1 -> EG3 window.
[]
